.Dd Sep 16, 2002
.Dt FNTEDITFS 1
.Os
.Sh "نام (NAME)"
.Nm fnteditfs
.Nd a full-screen console font editor
.Sh "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.Nm
.Ar [fontfile]
.Sh "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
The
.Nm
utility allows easy editing of console fonts.
.Sh "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
The following command line options are supported:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ar [fontfile]
Specified which font file to load upon program startup. If no font file is given,
.Nm fnteditfs
will try to load the currently active font on console (if supported by OS, and its
has the right permissions to do so), and if that fails, it'll start with an empty font.
.Sh "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.Xr vidcontrol 1 ,
.Xr vidfont 1
.Sh AVAILABILITY
The latest release and some online documentation are available on the
.Nm fnteditfs
Page, URL http://fonteditfs.sourceforge.net/
.Sh "اشکالات (BUGS)"
Sure to be some. Please report the author if you find any.
.Sh "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.An Uri Shaked uri@keves.org
.Sh CONTRIBUTORS
.An Amir Shalem amir@boom.org.il
